   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Savanna Trust</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is implemented in Zimbabwe. The main target groups are communities in the rural, urban high density and mining areas. Through Theatre, Capacity building training, community outreach, review of policy, workshops, use of radio and social media the project aims to achieve an enhance grassroots awareness and understanding of their rights as enshrined in the constitution and capacity to advocate for the fulfilment, of their new constitutional socio-political and economic rights as well as the rights of women.</narrative>
  </description>
